<title>PORTUGAL: BES to announce H1 results July 22.</title>
<headline>BES to announce H1 results July 22.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Banco Espirito Santo (BES) said it would announce its half-year results on July 22.</p>
<p>The bank said it would make the announcement at 0900 GMT.</p>
<p>--Lisbon Editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
